<title>USA: Barr Brothers to accept tenders on NYS HFA issue.</title>
<headline>Barr Brothers to accept tenders on NYS HFA issue.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barr Bothers &amp; Co. said Monday it would be accepting tender offers on a New York State HFA general housing loan issue.</p>
<p>The tenders will be accepted June 26, 1997 at 1:00 p.m. EST. Time for settlement is July 1, 1997.</p>
<p>The authority reserves the right to reject any or all offers. Please contact Bob Zmuidins or Peter Mangin at 212-363-4090 or fax 212-269-7637.</p>
<p>The following is a description of the bonds to be purchased:  </p>
